      "questName": "The Shape Of A Host",
      "questDescription": "Interpret the OS fingerprint with its confidence level and supporting TTL clue.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Embedded Linux at 87% confidence and TTL 64 support a hypothesis, not a confirmed identity.",
